{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 590,
  "batch_count": 1662,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "c0513553da490a692523f45b5f779f99f6cb7e34",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f3d6bf5a4bdc0cb6696d5ba",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "偉大なる魔女グランマよ。昔、魔法の箒のよ\\nうにレースを軽やかに駆け抜けたんだから！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa843ef17fc5c84d3125dbd5da2057a3f0663172948c19dc5209dcddaba5d124",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "497"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:432f8a7e7b16fc69c0c6c0c1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "ふん、使い魔に恥ずかしいところは\\n見せないわ。期待しておいて！",
      "source_fingerprint": "53a703293f4f128df7193049427b06dee5cb161abaa40b9d4decebc25c364542",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "498"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f8becca27ee6fd2d05822ef",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我会宠爱大家♪帮忙打扫洗衣服或\\n任～何事情，然后……呵呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ddf67917e864124fcfd2acdb7886f49e0885ca5ea9067dba437f4e907d2a2e1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "499"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be87bd13c7904a506e3ccdd7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嗯……跑到室友惊呼\\n「怎么还在跑！」的程度……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7b7d3058e5727491730f9c1e248354a42f6f994469d5a0e03e04d94f0ed97a4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8566eecbef4b0003e1f9fc9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "「吃菜头讨彩头」，为了对这个伟大的\\n顺口溜致敬，我今天特地吃了萝卜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ff42b2c6573e81fa854badc7fb23fc280571f011e7eefa4124ea750f8cd74df",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "50"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a9e8fd6d3b78457a20de72e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那个……我担心记者小姐眼睛下面的\\n黑眼圈。你要好好休息才行喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f73924aa673eec3b365095237df282f81396d35eeb266bb8fa88ea5503a93e07",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "500"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6370b2dc5507959ff101b453",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我做了饭团和大家一起吃。希望大家的努力和\\n成果都能像饭团的米饭一样黏在一起～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "bbe3cd4e2f7dbd7ee85b268ddffd1c0f882b1e7c664833f71645937458c22fc5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "501"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f1edadbf6ea2a75cb0d413a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "当然，不论是舞蹈、歌唱还是粉丝互动都～\\n准备万全啰♪啊，你是问竞赛？",
      "source_fingerprint": "193c6e63672d3a00fef1f9453d75c267201d4a48b39755f1f890d4c647512be4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "502"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b0178714948261fc1196a1b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "唱演唱会歌曲就自然而然能放松啰☆\\n大力推荐这么做喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f417c3812bd5dcacac5535bc0e3e7a18ea40c68b3cb90f545c84b7c7a1d12962",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "503"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8625d146929eec25cf2d4d0d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "吃了水果三明治喔☆毕竟参加竞赛\\n需要能量，得吃甜的东西！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e96b68a7a05e85433016f8d72b10e795cb613bf8ebecb4e40febd66f9e078ea",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "504"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9870922e520b951ebcba1b8a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "太好了，连我也能接受正式的采访……\\n啊，没事，那个，我会努力的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "25c51bdb2535879a961abfda51fbae78dbeb8eb331970bb542b6c30cb9f3aada",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "505"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96d213819c9af5ab90cfff96",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是的，我很喜欢看书。\\n但比赛的发展我却完全猜不透呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd64bee890b2d7eb67d3b91feed5301c65b332c45f387728dd2851679e3daba0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "506"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6fe02bcca97e78cdfa2cda15",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "冒险故事。这次的比赛会成为怎样的冒险……\\n那个、我很期待。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e086324082453d9f37e2b56eb6d0dde330b3848fd6fac57fd6fe4d0ae58b79ef",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "507"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04c03c9ba50a87a0304eea0a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我哪会去想那种事情啊？\\n反正，只要去做姑且就会赢吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8226295d1f76e136600586bf8c33e95e60463aca7a4bb64e56d3c224998758da",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "508"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2574ace1231c43bd771c4aca",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "如何？好看吧！话说我今天被超多人盯着看，\\n大概是因为弄得比平时还漂亮吧～",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6a446b3092a3a8515ba5ea2bed79b0387f46c0aa927aedf589749c8d2b93501",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "509"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6bfcd8d3d16a2c0c3c38ebd4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "皇帝的进击不会因为些许泥泞就停止。\\n我只需以我应有的姿态，朝顶点前进。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c06592861a4637cbba29342e7408467fc9e576968763bf0e7dc536f63411517e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "51"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b6733a0131dc2f5bade3c9a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "总之就是要喝运动饮料。\\n名字叫开……开特……是什么来着啊？",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb2699026ff8abcc608d8e35e6e16beb26b65ed73fbc575aa9b55fccff2cd887",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "510"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2156be1d3619b55fceb61542",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "谁知道。\\n──所以才让人热血沸腾吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef91a32cc1e2b8d28639759583108f27f8a39ff3fb76cadb670e971c13ad2c8c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "511"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1aae02a3848220fc219daa07",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在第三弯道附近展开攻势……应该吧。\\n所以呢，你信吗？还是说──",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec1bfad7a66a4393189083a44f33275f6dbd1ba30a68372655af8c774c594aba",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "512"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50930707e0db662e12ac7274",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我很期待喔……\\n一起享受极限对战的乐趣吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf2a9f5aef0b00c01fb763494e64580e5cff0815cc0f33268f604ff98749a314",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "513"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52fa32e3be8e3adee4fda803",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "喔……谢谢。你真是个怪人耶。",
      "source_fingerprint": "151be11ec470acab03a2c729f18c2a18a02274649923239275bfe62ae1203f0e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "514"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:719167cc31f242e83526b4e3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "也没有说很擅长啦……只是\\n有空的时候会玩……顶多这样吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc865a5849b2e590c4667a9de955e896fdc54b27866c896870a38672cf62c8a8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "515"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1f6c5b4aad3513b2456fb92",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……不就是不认为自己很强吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab51380cc7f09568399b89c691f208e5f1047bf55a2f375c229fc045dba9de08",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "516"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4ce28b96db6db52915405b4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "好、好的……！我虽然还只是小小的花蕾，\\n但会努力让自己漂亮地盛开的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3961228ebb4bde1bb7a496ac0b23b5ac84f5009feacbb63943ff56eaea15216f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "517"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66448712c46cb508bebf1821",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "虽然跟其他人相比还不是那么可靠，\\n不过希望大家可以在一旁见证我的成长。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe9e1e8c2d00362a647839c7412e0eadc491212b6af554032d6ee443cbd7b477",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "518"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f43f2e14ed59c613486834e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嗯～是马铃薯炖肉和蛋包饭。\\n我可以只用平底锅就把蛋皮漂亮地卷起来♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "4739d4ef3a5f9e3ad0d716d0e7bb14e22273d0ae3798343b916f61a15806a496",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "519"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0126f756e511943bf1f1bea3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我只相信自己的力量。不过当花坛里\\n冒出新芽时，应该算是好日子。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1941a5e4e6a11a945f40d68a3c7f417b1333b35d6ae9de893eafe6c21f6057a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "52"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:afb0ee8a74f7a4838175fe9a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那是什么！？在哪里可以吃到！？\\n我想吃看看致胜料理──！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a44565b2beea7c6263a7ae5673605fc0cf8e88eb191ebc269658e6decccff4b4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "520"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d4f01c351817901630c775c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "竞赛不是「庙」喔！\\n它让人既兴奋又非常开心──！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc2b1884909252ceef98aa7152701d1fc5c26625c8fabd3e7a3dc08b018af700",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "521"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c89e7e206751ad72f3a5a0f6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "做了很多喔！其中最有趣的，我想想──\\n跟米米做人力手推车体操！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8936686ace56503c0165ed6cf0030f14f989bd98293949990b554fc1f667789a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "522"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db52c1c7c432b2f01ea6afad",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "堂堂正正一决胜负吧！\\n请多指教！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c353ac23d3e9b0470d86a6cc65effaf13afa1c44e988b2f3ced1114984183597",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "523"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd1885175bdeab126e328531",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "魔鬼应该是参考传说故事的吧。咦？不过\\n故事中的魔鬼，好像都是被讨伐的一方……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b20d99fd1e2bbf17ce31fbb2364ec2ae1ff73401871a9f32132098e570ee088b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "524"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c223a712c8029d69b6d2aba",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是我父亲。今天的比赛他一定也会看，\\n所以我绝对不能输！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "667f6fe50b3cf10295e3950676770e6827b26ebe2aea8bffb307243c7cb18b57",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "525"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36671073b5174e0e57c900e1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "とうっ！　ヒーロー見参！　愛と平和と\\nにんじんのため、ビコーペガサス出走だ！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "411277315c512fcd10ad0653749f41ea2c9f6e02794d9dcca04ef02e85e47f96",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "526"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5e3ef1f838106dc782f7151",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "もちろん、キャロットマンだ！　いつだって\\nカッコいい、憧れのヒーローだぞ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "28d647aca9e52a815adcc0349f6325dd445e7b3474c43820e84cee47011ae473",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "527"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9395ce149063bc3cb8415d0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "ああ、誰よりも速くゴールに駆けつける。\\nそれがヒーローの役目だからな！",
      "source_fingerprint": "30a47038336361baecdc40358730cefb566bbc25eaba15837c005e9b3d2f8578",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "528"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:997caa6344bfc6ae01f2d1ef",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嗯！我有确实减少补充水分了！\\n状态非常好哦☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "600a5557e0abe17f273408684620e4d58853b70a04c55633fceff4ef9d490a38",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "529"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a378d756d91d3b6f76474773",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "说不累是骗人的，但我不觉得辛苦。\\n一切都是让自己成长的养分。",
      "source_fingerprint": "45b6134480cb392c5ee1e804d20c3bc4fa8c3c1c57f40ef3a9a5c8380bb54321",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "53"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:674d4da56187d2177cae2a8f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "现在！与你的相遇，\\n就是一场美丽☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9446398009cb58f46cc762ca4c4f8fd5a5e6f450755a9e5c2aeda48a7fbd730",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "530"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4bdf1eafc80fa40294396a13",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "无论是你还是我都很美丽☆\\n让我们跑出美丽的比赛吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bcb8689a31a4e3f7c59bc01674cf613877abc861eca5b158bbb5a9c68b23d0ab",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "531"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b7fdbee67321bcc78c34ec2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "当然！大、大、大、大、大、大……\\n大可放心！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1784e2e2d0bc870fb5efef288a2c71e63fef7d3ca1a43abf5b1d443799264852",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "532"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d96cdbd4526b99374630d5d9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "唔唔……看到了！\\n如果我赢的话就是大吉！交给我吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "af4a66e30a3ea205f287848942b8faf1b43058a85dc5269447f8c62cb9b3f1f3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "533"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c51471f9c8984a1f0360fbe",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "会降临吗？不，是确定会降临！因为我睡觉前\\n有拍3下枕头并默念「Shiraoki大人」！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3d48c1ad44483af1115bca0db35e60d0a549a43026bac039bb979ede6bdfb87",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "534"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0acb2366b26c8a3618cbd132",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我会争取胜利，但不会让自己抱着\\n非赢不可的压力。总之，看着我吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee49907c7ab2e255ca692e9b111244e445d7794768477dd3c4d50c891b235927",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "535"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87611e44e2076e67206e51ec",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "很令人兴奋对吧！但不论对手是谁，\\n我都只会照自己喜欢的方式去跑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f427b7893c1c77256c836a5ea804ecf1503486429d9d60c6e33d3b31bab5cf5e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "536"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2f6a2c97379236e66dd242f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在散步时我看见了颠倒的彩虹。\\n或许今天的比赛也会变得很有趣哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9fc61ce19e707e22d2f2bb358f5772fe509f7050da597fd7ab901b1bc54a230",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "537"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:940b9c522c35beac18f6fb38",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "对、对不起。因为太紧张，所以\\n脸色有点苍白……我、我会加油的……",
      "source_fingerprint": "46bf555db34615d240c4e6923151673a82593efc2c6db754017b5c9f58cc9c05",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "538"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5ad1fa3066a8939409db5e5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那、那个，从我的嘴里\\n说出好歌剧的名字……真的可以吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "433d0145464536da872854248e24f68f2b56f8576095b8dee7face45aeee4f6d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "539"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:331b808e2a4ec6c17bafebde",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "就是累积过人的锻炼。在绝对的自信面前，\\n紧张感只不过是沧海一粟。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbba76fe69f15b674faa9c9b060a9b87e51fe3b4f10331aff43ea2fc6fc49e9e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "54"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e12b933de1775a3fc0cc2000",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "就是无论发生什么事都要跑到最后……\\n对、对不起，我一副很了不起的样子……",
      "source_fingerprint": "576c8892ffa594624404afbc8c5e1d4537055917ce954b2fc8f5630d3f4a74d2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "540"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2879f2c1ee9f2b8d82278298",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……是熏衣草的香氛。\\n可以缓和我的紧张情绪，所以才……",
      "source_fingerprint": "186a6483f0cbe7e6d9ba3c125d361e3adcbdca10f203dd6c6c56207c1f8da29f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "541"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d83669a95e70138c97f0d47b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "咦……为什么会知道……\\n爸爸真是的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3addf15a6be22b628ffd9793375d47444c2b23dd573c2ddfdfa9a7d72c0ee75",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "542"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e26cb299a70c9fb99a4040f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我说的话根本……不过……好吧。\\n我会加油不让大家失望……",
      "source_fingerprint": "cfa098f4d5cc77c1d6457cee4eb6f40d46e99cff0885f6075e3081e1a30ba6ee",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "543"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d85096d69278affde24ce532",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "因为最近网络上的广告影片也很有看头……\\n等我把东西放进购物车后才清醒过来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e7d88ca05137a280254045a4bf562ac45de1e4d3509e6fac04313adc09c2149",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "544"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:701333561f7f86873cbc3c44",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我会非常打拼，请多指教咧～！\\n……呃，为什么是福冈腔！？（笑）",
      "source_fingerprint": "132877ebbbf34ab0705c1bdacea0e77fdce2928de2ba4e9a7fb166acb049ea93",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "545"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64a427474e11f164b535bb0a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嗯。用纵横赛场的表现登上综合情报节目。\\n哈哈……刚、刚才的还是剪掉吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "36fa10beecf76cccdaa166c08e029371d3819a1737a971cd0f23cff41e876881",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "546"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56dfe6eab5b65f0ea9d6eb76",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "帝王奔驰不但练习距离比任何人都长，而且还\\n兼顾质量！好好期待正式竞赛吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc7b225bc347964f72ecb9368eab0474a280d8be71c15a5259f9a7b105e4f39c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "547"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df9fc879088a74b3262b1434",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "因为天空推荐的教科书，白白浪费了时间！\\n猫猫威能是什么啦！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "03b9d9ab72ef6087d520aae05dda3d85db22c9a3c196477215dee424b779ae46",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "548"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6af2be09965fceedfc96d8f3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "通常会出门逛街买东西。不用邮购，\\n因为我要用自己的眼睛看穿哪些才是一流的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e76117cdd31a9ef1591cb39cf05c5d9a25d644baac6a359d30ef1d4c1fd8cfa3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "549"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbb3dd03de82922842e54e87",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "大家今天也会挥洒青春的汗水吧！\\n我会到最前线好好欣赏！看我的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2acf729815960eab3fc640a5716b5ba8a799dae6a881b77550f91201dba9ab4a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "55"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e86e95791cfba11ae44682f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "觉、觉得很辣……当时因为想确定这不是梦，\\n所以我直接咬了洋葱……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fde817eaba72d9df8a1f2e6817c0c09259c24f32d02e3a4f5145603af9ef3826",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "550"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:818fa588100a1d46d755f581",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嗯～想对很多人表示感谢。当然，\\n到时候也会一并向他们报告我获得了优胜！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3795f0eb4cb41ec1569fef818d1e40e23e742a54528f8a2aea800e83e920d0e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "551"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:61fc59fb495e03daaa00c194",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "没有……我是因为单纯喜欢跑步才奔跑的。\\n这点之后也不会改变。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a84f8e67f422b37fa76accb297279f020003c40a0b34ec35b13fdb8150079d1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "552"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9034eb3f831b25809e2cfb15",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "想参加各种竞赛，从中见识还没有\\n看过的景色。试着拜托看看好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf04ae74c7c73bda84b7021ee0740e7ef9d0f50eae3152f9f04c3168617030f5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "553"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51bfdbe7441a0283c5a06826",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……当然是那些替我加油的所有粉丝们啊！\\n这还用问吗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4cd958c01631738524264345e610376bd6f01315c11134553967023c05355e46",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "554"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:213405a4ff68537643bfcf91",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我接受挑战！我既不会跑也不会躲……\\n不……若被追上还是会跑就是，嘿嘿嘿～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "adba1586e95c49ad0f4f1cd2cc1b16276e31efc3a7afa32b4d0a6475a23ad693",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "555"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04f8675a7c9e6d64f2c6bc49",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呵呵，我还不会让路给你们喔。\\n有时也勇敢踩下油门奔驰吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "738f51313bc146bc121258d6568e3b2d3c722f2e87accf3cd339391bfd6ac8f3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "556"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2f3a3cf2d08506c8cfa8c79",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哎呀，全都不能漏看喔？就跟流行一样，\\n瞬间就会被抛在后面的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b970fca6fbe024356b2d9b43f9fd2b76b069114d38d1f405934331da3b3eaeb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "557"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d6ac46d9b8382cce56564cd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呵呵，你摸摸右边的口袋看看？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a004473ab0e798af219d8f976f2a9f4ef47778e172a9a1326007cba777980c8b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "558"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbf8abdc91914ad404554052",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "感谢大家平常的支持。\\n我会为了你们创造奇迹。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9251d47999dde7c519db829b55a78237a63cd421db622fbf256364b115d888cb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "559"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3108293f7e11d2ab09e5770b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "咿呀！意思是叫我选出谁是主推吗！？\\n办、办不到！我是箱推！所有赛马娘都很尊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ecac65aa20bcfdd6a3b602be43600a875a69230717507bc9b08f6bc9aaa1b236",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "56"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8f7f6213e51c38afb18a674",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "鱿鱼……螃蟹……嗯，我都喜欢，\\n尤其是鱿鱼烧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe6644ae559b7f49e8caada3477ff773bcc90b34021c0ee3d44e38b7b94153c1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "560"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59e62c47f21609af6b33a0b4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……无法只用一句话总结。所以希望大家注目\\n于我的表现。我想表达的──应该都在里面。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b355738733ed9a854c6bfed8b2ff65ef52354a93c613b02b6250d421334d4a9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "561"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66ab0f48f7eb7dc82171e470",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "虽然有针对赛道变形机关拟定对策，\\n但我忘记指令是什么了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "093fbf071c3b7be985c99fb685767bce2f30864e141364c3e8677f700f353bfc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "562"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1ee4429db1f551d4d779417",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "喝──啊！！被我透过函授教育学到的\\n「截拳道」吓得连睡觉都会发抖吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2c632dfbe6804fa08dd34bde3ceeb67b77ae928784d4e8381479080d7290ed5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "563"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09f05325ac55bd9ea3f12d77",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "还是叫「史上最强」比较帅吧！！\\n啊～如果绣在袖子上会被骂吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5965c2b1925c68ed22aaf16cc5d87f2c97a9a5cd56c242f1f1c075fa0cd62fa",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "564"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:779dfd2a5099985aab02a6fa",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "唔～我不擅长数字这类琐碎的事情。\\n总而言之，我会尽全力冲刺！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd50063056bf4aa166764ba655fca1d419c7dfc9fb194a02612e6545e99b46d5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "565"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00186a48dbae4aa8783cfd2b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我不认为能轻松拿到第1，\\n所以我比任何人都努力练习！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d35fbac626738e269167b294d76797b505fa2efebc4ca4448be65bb73a29edb0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "566"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7c35aab69c3aa690cdbe462",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……求之不得！请准备刊登\\n「大和赤骥获得优胜」的特辑吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "976c76a9f6f1c19ac04fa014c424f806c01f6a094be6708870e464697f518a08",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "567"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95d365373e1cfa6587ddd0f3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "像bison那样冲刺！放牛吃草喔！\\nWell……我有说对吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7bdd24c0f388bf79ad4c637e76ad6f32dc24b80eff15d5f4f2ade72bc7ea894",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "568"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
